{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run the caf\u00e9 of your dreams!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner entrepreneur. Balance renovation, product selection, customer service, and outdoor ambiance to build the ultimate caf\u00e9 experience and keep your customers coming back for more.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/4d3c991a88245d5b8b610e655f82285a.webp?t=1759149781\" width=610 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/5f23f9847ad17f38f6b32b8675f24c19.poster.avif?t=1759149781\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/5f23f9847ad17f38f6b32b8675f24c19.webm?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/5f23f9847ad17f38f6b32b8675f24c19.mp4?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpack items, fill up the shelves and keep your caf\u00e9 buzzing with clientele. Some guests crave the newest trends, some love to discover something new, while others stick to their daily ritual. Choose wisely \u2014 the right selection will make everyone feel at home.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/89284224a40c799400143951dc415d43.webp?t=1759149781\" width=610 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/be1981aaa2dce2bbad9a97722f534ef6.poster.avif?t=1759149781\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/be1981aaa2dce2bbad9a97722f534ef6.webm?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/be1981aaa2dce2bbad9a97722f534ef6.mp4?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step behind the counter and keep the line moving! Take payments, expand your menu with new licenses, and invest in advanced equipment to serve faster and better. Oh \u2014 don't forget inviting decorations that turn quick visits into repeatable stays.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/8f8f50470ef3de88ab8e50b9880afef5.webp?t=1759149781\" width=610 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/50ab409a5d832eb94a9b8077ff9d4ead.poster.avif?t=1759149781\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/50ab409a5d832eb94a9b8077ff9d4ead.webm?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/50ab409a5d832eb94a9b8077ff9d4ead.mp4?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every guest has their own taste and mood. Watch how they browse, react to prices, and settle on their favorites. Some rush in for a coffee on the go, while others like to linger at a table to soak in the atmosphere. Keep them happy \u2014 they\u2019re likely to thank you with some generous tips.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/7bbc95868ac4ceb66a902dfd1a8e0f0c.webp?t=1759149781\" width=610 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/7fb10d9899f32a19ccdfc1be563e3ce7.poster.avif?t=1759149781\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/7fb10d9899f32a19ccdfc1be563e3ce7.webm?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/7fb10d9899f32a19ccdfc1be563e3ce7.mp4?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sparkling caf\u00e9 makes everyone smile. Sweep the floors, polish the windows, and take out the trash yourself \u2014 or bring in employees to keep things spotless while you focus on running the place.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/830279d10d1a7b6f3f3314ee9bd905a1.webp?t=1759149781\" width=610 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/e65b793b2be8d9b7085b1a04787af143.poster.avif?t=1759149781\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/e65b793b2be8d9b7085b1a04787af143.webm?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/e65b793b2be8d9b7085b1a04787af143.mp4?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants, fridges, tables, chairs \u2014 every detail shapes the vibe. Mix and match furniture, rearrange layouts, and create a caf\u00e9 that reflects your style and vision.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/27a4b769b6e8b4f513e9089494c403fc.webp?t=1759149781\" width=610 height=49 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/50aee43f1f2a5f3c245cb33c8bc293f9.poster.avif?t=1759149781\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/50aee43f1f2a5f3c245cb33c8bc293f9.webm?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/50aee43f1f2a5f3c245cb33c8bc293f9.mp4?t=1759149781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the outdoor space into a charming retreat with decorative plants, personalized canopies, and atmospheric lighting. Creating a cozy outdoor ambiance not only enhances your caf\u00e9\u2019s appeal but also provides the perfect spot for customers to relax and savor the moment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3078950?t=1759149781","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3078950?t=1759149781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/85077810dcddd5af0710464d101975f725f1ddc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759149781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/85077810dcddd5af0710464d101975f725f1ddc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759149781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"descr